  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 纯1"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "4:12 P.M.  天氣/晴\n卡西米爾中部，四城聯合，“大騎士領”卡瓦萊利亞基\n某處不堪入目的車禍現場"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......我們還趕得上晚上的酒會嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "趕不上也是你的錯，老弗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的錯？哈！我的錯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你非要帶著你的破箱子，足足三十公斤！你是嫌自己不夠胖嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是幫馬丁修東西的工具！好，所以這就是你撞在樹上的藉口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要質疑我的方向感！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說的是你老眼昏花......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你忘了上星期我是怎麼奪得酒吧飛鏢冠軍的嗎？你瞎了我都不會眼花的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我瞎不了，所以我清清楚楚提醒過你，“前面那有棵樹”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎麼不記得？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為音響的聲音太大了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是誰把塞壬的新碟放進去的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......別吵，讓丫頭專心檢查！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔啊......這撞得也太徹底了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都怪老弗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......你......瑪莉婭，少聽他胡扯，這件事不能怪我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行啦行啦，等我再檢查一下，嘿咻——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽見沒？吵到丫頭了，少說幾句吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "線路，OK，但發動機還是沒有反應，唔，這是上上代的產品了吧，是這樣驅動的嗎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "引擎沒有反應，那乾脆手動法術點火試試......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是這樣吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，每次看丫頭捏著光的樣子，都會讓人想起她爺爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是！看看人家瑪莉婭！你怎麼就一點源石技藝都不懂呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰說我不會修源石裝置的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說的是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪莉婭！讓一讓！今天我要讓這個老傢伙開開眼界！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哈哈......二老就別鬧了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊！有反應了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這樣......再這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦哦！引擎聲！我親愛的引擎聲！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "瑪莉婭是真的一天比一天厲害了，依我看，某個老頭差不多也該正式退休了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，沒有的事啦，還不是科瓦爾師傅教得好嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽見沒！聽見沒！聽——見——沒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁，別囉嗦，上車。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "丫頭，你接下來去哪兒？要不要順便載你一程？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我接下來有別的事情啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那好吧。抓穩了，科瓦爾，今夜的第一杯酒必須得進我肚子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那還用說——慢著，引擎的聲音是不是有點——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "出發！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你幹嘛還開那麼快！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我年輕時候的衝刺可比這還快！而且其實我沒踩油門！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃？等等，七十邁了，慢——慢點啊，喂，八十邁了！超速了！超速了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_120",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢不下來！我說了我沒踩油門！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_101",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就——！刹車，刹車啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_black"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_kxstreet"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀......啊哈哈......這次是源石引擎超載了嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像又搞錯了，誒嘿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_arena_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "歡迎各位來到卡西米爾——在這裡，你可以享受到獨特的美食和迷人的風景，充分感受卡西米爾獨特的風土人情——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但誰在乎這些啊！此時此刻，唯一佔據各位內心的，只會是騎士競技！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是莫布，大嘴莫布！榮幸地為大家帶來今天的比賽解說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡瓦萊利亞基中央賽區，呼嘯競技場，今天也將為各位帶來騎士們的風采！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本日賽事依舊由呼嘯守衛公司全權贊助，單日積分前十的選手，都將獲得呼嘯守衛公司提供的限量版刀具商品“暴亂者”一把！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那花裡胡哨的玩意賣不出去了......唉，賣得出去就有鬼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，反正是老東家的......唔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來自卡西米爾——不，泰拉各地的競賽騎士們！卡西米爾商業聯合會的各大公司代表都將注目著今天的獨立騎士競賽！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是在競速賽中一馬當先，還是在射技賽中拔得頭籌？無論參與何種賽事，都有著獲得董事代表青睞的機會！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然！！還有萬眾矚目的一對一綜合競技！最高的積分，最高的曝光率！任何一場比賽都可能讓你被騎士團相中，從此一步登天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要參與卡西米爾騎士特別錦標賽嗎？想要屹立於眾多騎士的頂峰嗎？現在，門票就在各位參賽騎士的手上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰勝對手，贏得榮耀，歡呼吧！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_061",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "深呼吸......深呼吸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼事不宜遲，立刻開始本日的第一場——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等——等等！這個參賽選手......似乎大有來頭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯！我是說，今天的頭場比賽就將成為未來幾天內卡西米爾競賽頻道的熱點新聞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原因無他，只因這位頭次參賽的選手，有著一個響亮的“名號”！可愛的年輕女孩，卻來自一個聲名顯赫的家族！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果關注騎士競技——不，但凡是卡西米爾的忠實客戶，一定不會對這個名字陌生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少廢話兩句行不行！快讓新人出場啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，把今天比賽的安排給我拿過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的，瑟奇亞克閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都是些熟面孔啊，唔......等等，是最下面這個？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "企業員工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_109",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的......選拔已經開始半個月了，現在才開始累積積分的獨立騎士並不常見，所以我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塑膠騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_103",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個姓氏——是耀騎士的——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_121",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事不宜遲，讓我們以最熱烈的呼聲迎接本日賽場內的第一位參賽騎士——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
